{"pageid": 804, "title": "Jason Parker", "revid": 1923, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Deceased", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Jason Parker</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3b/Jason_Parker.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215170830\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Jason Parker\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3b/Jason_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215170830\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3b/Jason_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215170830 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3b/Jason_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215170830 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Jason Parker\" width=\"270\" height=\"79\" data-image-key=\"Jason_Parker.png\" data-image-name=\"Jason Parker.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Disemboweled by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC8&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Parker_Parents\" title=\"Parker Parents\">Unnamed parents</a><p><a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey Parker</a> † <small>(older brother)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan Parker</a> † <small>(older brother)</small><br />Unnamed third sibling †<br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #8</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Jason Parker</b> was a teenage boy living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> with his three siblings during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span> of 2020. While with his family to identify the remains of his third sibling, he and his other brothers were attacked and killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Jason was the younger brother of <a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan Parker</a>, and the brother of a third unnamed sibling. Corey claims that he watches hentai on the family computer.\n</p><p>At some point, the boys' third sibling was taken and killed by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">a monster</span>. When their parents were asked to identify the body, Jason requested they \"tag along.\" Once in the parking lot of the school, Jason ran into the woods, with his brothers following after him. Unfortunately, Jason was soon killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The brief appearance of his corpse shows that at least one of his legs was ripped off, and his intestines were pulled from his chest.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC8&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>His and his siblings' deaths would later be blamed on Tommy Mahoney.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Not much of Jason's corpse is seen, or his physical appearance known. Brendan describes him as shorter than his brothers, and wearing gym shorts.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"546262ad32921fdc899c86324232b029\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:56px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Jason_Parker-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:54px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Jason_Parker.png\" title=\"Jason Parker.png (1.04 MB)\" style=\"height:54px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3b/Jason_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215170830\" title=\"Jason Parker.png (1.04 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Jason&#039;s body, Issue #8.\" height=\"54\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Jason Parker.png\" data-image-key=\"Jason_Parker.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Jason&#039;s body, .\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Jason Parker.png (1.04 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Jason&#39;s body, Issue #8.\" height=\"54\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Jason Parker.png\" data-image-key=\"Jason_Parker.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Jason&#39;s body, .\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/3b/Jason_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215170830\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Jason's body, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a>.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC8-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC8_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC8_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">vol. #2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">issue no. 8</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2020.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC9-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC9_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=